DOMAIN: Dussel's Core Critique of Eurocentrism — Myth of Modernity, 1492, Transmodernity
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-04-30
PAPERS_FOUND: 13 total (High: 8, Medium: 4, Low: 1)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, IEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CrossRef
